  495:<h2 id="preface">Preface</h2>
  496-<div class="sectionbody">
  497-<div class="paragraph">
  --
  516-<p>Hibernate takes care of the mapping from Java classes to database tables, and from Java data types to SQL data
  517-types. In addition, it provides data query and retrieval facilities. It can significantly reduce development
  518:time otherwise spent with manual data handling in SQL and JDBC.  Hibernate’s design goal is to relieve the
  519-developer from 95% of common data persistence-related programming tasks by eliminating the need for manual,
  520:hand-crafted data processing using SQL and JDBC.  However, unlike many other persistence solutions, Hibernate
  521-does not hide the power of SQL from you and guarantees that your investment in relational technology and
  522-knowledge is as valid as always.</p>
  --
